  "description": "Operating Area: France and Italy\n\nSAMIRA is a 76ft (23m) motor yacht built by Riva in 2024, with design by Ferretti Group. She accommodates up to 8 guests in 4 cabins comprising 2 double and 2 twin, with a professional crew of 2 ensuring an exceptional charter experience. Available for charter in France, Italy. Notable features include under 24m u2013 Perfect Size for Mediterranean Cruising, 4 Guest Cabins for 8 Guests with full beam Master, spacious Outdoor Living Areas, and sleek, Sporty & Iconic Italian Design.\n\nKEY FEATURES: \n• Under 24m – Perfect Size for Mediterranean Cruising \n• 4 Guest Cabins for 8 Guests with full beam Master\n• Spacious Outdoor Living Areas\n• Sleek, Sporty & Iconic Italian Design",
